<title>GERMANY: Rexrodt says German H1 growth 0.7 pct from prev yr.</title>
<headline>Rexrodt says German H1 growth 0.7 pct from prev yr.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Economics Minister Guenter Rexrodt said German GDP grew 0.7 percent in the first half of 1996 from the same year-earlier period. -- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
